  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> moderate transmutation; <strong>CL</strong> 7th; <strong>Slot</strong> neck; <strong>Price</strong> 2,000 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 1/2&nbsp;lb.</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nOne of the best ways to make the universe hide its face in shame is to remind it of its failings, and since all truenamers know there's some lingering unhappiness with the platypus, it tends to be the icon of choice. The DC to recite recitations defensively increases by +2 for all creatures that are within the wearer's threatened area.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Wondrous Item, ode to the porcupine; <strong>Cost</strong> 1,000 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/truenaming-items#toc28\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
